{"slug":"Universal-Script-RawPlayer-41932","_id":"6843c696343da7b997f03581","title":"RawPlayer","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"# RawPlayer\nThis is a remake of the GITHUB AUDIO PLAYER V1.0 script, and we have made it with more interesting features than the other script.\n\n# How to Use?\nFirst, you need to have the URL or something, or you can search for it on Google, but if you don't find the link you want, then you need to upload it yourself, we recommend using mp3 file extension because it is more efficient, then copy the raw link of the song, if you still don't understand, please search on YouTube how to do it for further instructions.\n\n# Bonus\nThere is a secret feature in this script! Try to find it!\n\n# Credit\nFyanDev - Script writer\nverifed_age - Tester\nysuskntl1 - UI Designer\n\n# Example URL\n-- EEYUH x Fluxxwave | HR\nhttps://github.com/fiangg20/Fian_gg-Repo/raw/refs/heads/main/EEYUH!%20x%20Fluxxwave.mp3\n\n-- Somebody's Pleasure (Extended Version) | Aziz Hedra\nhttps://github.com/fiangg20/Fian_gg-Repo/raw/refs/heads/main/Aziz%20Hedra%20-%20Somebody's%20Pleasure%20(Extended%20Version).mp3\n\n# YouTube Audio Download\nIf you want to download some song from YouTube, we recommend to use YouTube Converter OrangeMP3\n-- Official Link\nhttps://orangemp3.com\n\n# Inspired by\n• GITHUB AUDIO PLAYER - Original script\n• Sirius - Blur effect at opening RawPlayer\n• TopBarPlus - Floating button\n• YARHM - Rotating gradient in uistroke\n\nI hope you all like it!\nbtw i hate ugly UI/UX\nand I made this script for 2 days without sleeping, if I slept, maybe it could be finished in 4 days.","tags":["music","musicplayer","httpget","rawlink","getcustom*et"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reprenzy-hue/config/refs/heads/main/somefuckingapps'))()\n\n--[[\n==============================================================\n🎵 RawPlayer - URL Music Player (v4.3)\n🧠 Created by: Fyan\n📅 Year: 2025\n==============================================================\n\n📌 DESCRIPTION:\nRawPlayer is a sleek, custom-built Roblox music player that allows\nyou to stream .mp3 audio files directly from raw URLs (GitHub, CDN, etc).\nIt supports local caching and plays sound through getcustomasset.\n\n==============================================================\n\n✨ MAIN FEATURES:\n• Play music from raw .mp3 URLs\n• Smart file caching (no re-download if file exists)\n• Minimal, animated user interface (fade, slide, blur)\n• Real-time duration display (00:00 / 03:25)\n• Volume slider with draggable thumb and percentage\n• Mini equalizer visualizer with smooth transitions\n• Bass boost mode using EqualizerSoundEffect\n• Sound ducking — lowers all other game sounds smoothly\n• Mute all other sounds except the player\n• Floating button to open/close the UI\n• Now Playing label with filename auto-decoding\n• Welcome message for first-time and returning users\n• GUI visibility management (auto hides all ScreenGuis)\n• Gradient UIStroke animation that rotates with sound\n• Duplicate protection: Prevents re-execution of UI\n\n==============================================================\n\n📁 FILE SYSTEM:\n- Folder: \"music_cache/\"\n- Automatically saves downloaded .mp3 files by filename\n- Avoids re-downloading files if already cached\n\n==============================================================\n\n⚠️ NOTES:\n• This script is optimized for performance and smooth UX.\n\n==============================================================\n\n📌 CURRENT VERSION: v4.3\n🌐 Published on: ScriptBlox\n\n❤️ Thank you for using RawPlayer!\n==============================================================\n]]\n\n-- sorry if not open source anymore\n\n--[[ Why don't I make this script open source anymore?\n#1.To be exactly like the original script\n• You know, that GITHUB AUDIO PLAYER V1.0 script is also obfuscated, so this script will be obfuscated too.\n\n#2.To be safe from skidders\n• Many people have stolen the script and edited it so that it doesn't look like the script, because this script has superior and good features, so this script will be very vulnerable to being stolen/skidded, so we obfuscated this script to make it safe.\n]]","owner":{"_id":"67aed9028bc60243193a51e7","username":"notfynnn","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/76ec1e04e15d72cb32007fef3a065e8472d4e369e19f5624916cc78ec153a35d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67aed9028bc60243193a51e7-1789048949106.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"67aed9028bc60243193a51e7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/76ec1e04e15d72cb32007fef3a065e8472d4e369e19f5624916cc78ec153a35d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67aed9028bc60243193a51e7-1789048949106.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":166564,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2f594294fd62ce66e8fee38ee1f4de4d15268eed7c480d6744a2d1dcdc082dfe.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1757658285557.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1757658285557.png"},"likeCount":6,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-06-07T04:56:54.654Z","editBy":{"_id":"67aed9028bc60243193a51e7","username":"notfynnn","status":"offline","id":"67aed9028bc60243193a51e7"},"executes":85765,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":58465,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:13:27.629Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"thumbnail":{"url":